  "description": "A lightweight, high-performance mediator implementation for .NET with advanced runtime behavior pipeline control. Features: ValueTask-first design, Behavior Groups, Selective Pipeline execution, Order control, fail-fast registration diagnostics (DuplicateHandlerPolicy and MissingHandlerPolicy), and zero runtime DI enumerations with significantly lower memory allocations compared to MediatR.",
